 the site","•","Reflect their organizational structure","and access needs","•","Bring in their data points","•","Set up their approvals","•","Bring in users","•","Bring in suppliers","•","Think through integrations and","implementation","•","More.."],"tables":[],"figures":[{"ref":"p10-img1","page":10}]},{"path":"p11","title":"Quick Review","level":1,"page":11,"paragraphs":["Quick Review","Custom Fields","Key Concepts:","•","Custom fields are used to track information specific to the client","organization.","•","Clients can have as many as they need.","•","Fields can appear throughout the application, including on documents, and","are often used to drive workflow and reporting."],"tables":[],"figures":[{"ref":"p11-img1","page":11}]},{"path":"p12","title":"Significance of Custom Fields","level":1,"page":12,"paragraphs":["Significance of Custom Fields","Types of Custom Fields:","•","Contract Custom Fields","•","Supplier Registration Questions (Custom Fields)","•","“Custom Fields” for ePro and AP","(what we’re discussing in this lesson)"],"tables":[],"figures":[{"ref":"p12-img1","page":12}]},{"path":"p13","title":"Look & Learn:","level":1,"page":13,"paragraphs":["Look & Learn:","Let’s Observe:","•","P2P Custom Fields","•","Contract Custom Fields","•","Supplier Registration Custom Fields","•","P2P Custom Fields (In Depth)","Custom Fields Across the JAGGAER Indirect Family"],"tables":[],"figures":[{"ref":"p13-img1","page":13}]},{"path":"p14","title":"For eProcurement & Invoicing (P2P)","level":1,"page":14,"paragraphs":["For eProcurement & Invoicing (P2P) Custom Fields"],"tables":[],"figures":[{"ref":"p14-img1","page":14},{"ref":"p14-img2","page":14}]},{"path":"p15","title":"Common P2P Example:","level":1,"page":15,"paragraphs":["Common P2P Example:","Accounting Codes","•","Each organization has its own set of codes, which","may be referred to by different terminology such as: o","Accounting Codes o","Budget Codes o","Chart of Accounts","P2P Custom Fields in Practice"],"ta