d (Fixed Asset Category) Values for","specific Parent (GL Code) Values in the system o","5105310 - Computer Equip & Accessories o","5105112 – Rent/Lease o","At least three other GL Code values of your choice","Creating Relationships"],"tables":[],"figures":[{"ref":"p41-img1","page":41}]},{"path":"p42","title":"Header-Level Parents","level":1,"page":42,"paragraphs":["Header-Level Parents","It’s now possible to have a","parent field in the header of a","document determine the","values available for","accounting code fields.","In this example, changing the","value of “Region” changes","the values available for","“District” – and maybe the","whole string.","Defining Custom Field Values"],"tables":[],"figures":[{"ref":"p42-img1","page":42}]},{"path":"p43","title":"Quiz Time","level":1,"page":43,"paragraphs":["Quiz Time","Type Your Answers in the Chat","What are some typical fields –","standard fields OR custom","fields – that you would expect","clients to want on their P2P","documents?"],"tables":[],"figures":[{"ref":"p43-img1","page":43},{"ref":"p43-img2","page":43}]},{"path":"p44","title":"Quiz Time","level":1,"page":44,"paragraphs":["Quiz Time","Type Your Answers in the Chat","In addition to Custom Fields","for ePro and Invoicing, what","other kinds of Custom Fields","exist, managed elsewhere in","the JAGGAER Indirect","environment?"],"tables":[],"figures":[{"ref":"p44-img1","page":44},{"ref":"p44-img2","page":44}]},{"path":"p45","title":"Setting Up Custom Fields for eProcurement","level":1,"page":45,"paragraphs":["Setting Up Custom Fields for eProcurement","Create and","configure the","Custom Field","Set up","potential","values","Specify","where the","field may","appear on","System","Documents","Set","Relationships","with other","Custom","Fields","Set up user","permissions","Place the","field on","specific","Documents","Use for","integrations,","workflow,","reporting,","etc."],"tables":[],"figures":[]},{"path":"p46","title":"Custom Field Permissions","level":1,"page"